 "titulo": "The monkey who fought all of Heaven 🐒 Sun Wukong Part 4 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "WAR ON HEAVEN",
 "descripcion": "Heaven tries to control Sun Wukong with a job. It goes very wrong: peaches of immortality, a furnace, and an army that cannot stop him.\n\n> Part 5: {when_next}.\nWho could stop him now?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 4 to 7.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a job in Heaven that is the *worst job* there.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Jade Emperor invites Wukong up, to keep him quiet.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He makes him keeper of the *heavenly horses*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then Wukong learns it is the lowest job there.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He flies home and calls himself *Great Sage, Equal to Heaven*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He beats Heaven's soldiers, so they give him the title.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And he guards the *peaches of immortality*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Some ripen once every nine thousand years.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong eats the biggest ones.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then he learns he was *not invited* to the banquet.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because this starts a war.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He drinks the wine and eats the pills of *Laozi*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Now he cannot die. Heaven sends a huge army.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Only the god *Erlang* catches him.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Laozi throws him into a furnace.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "For *forty-nine days*, he burns.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He jumps out with golden eyes, stronger than before.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "No one in Heaven can stop him.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So they call someone he has never met. Part five, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
